# Stripe webhook: ACK vs retry (learned 2026-10-03)

Live endpoint: `https://selpic.com.au/api/stripe/webhook` (`app/api/stripe/webhook/route.ts`).

## Invariant

Stripe retries every non-2xx delivery. Do **not** return 4xx for permanent persist failures after a valid signature — that causes dashboard failure email + retry storms. Do **not** blind-ACK 200 on every error (lost orders when Supabase is briefly down).

## Response policy

| Case | HTTP | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Valid signature + handled / ignored event | **200** `{ received: true }` | Success |
| Missing / invalid signature | **400** | Bad request; ops fix `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` |
| Secret unset | **503** | Retry until Vercel env fixed |
| Persist transient (DB 500/503, Stripe retrieve 500) | **5xx/503** | Stripe retries |
| Persist “Payment not completed” (400) | **retry status** | Race with `payment_status` |
| Persist permanent 400 (amount / metadata) | **200** + log `persistFailed` | Stop storm; `/success` → `/api/stripe/complete` may still save |
| Unexpected throw | **500** | Retry |

## Implementation notes

- Raw body: `await req.text()` then `constructEvent` — never `req.json()` first.
- Handled today: `checkout.session.completed` (`mode === 'payment'`). Other events → 200 (no `invoice.paid` yet).
- First insert: `persistVerifiedStripeSession(..., { notifyAdmins: false })` then `after(() => notifyAdminsOfNewOrder)` so Resend does not delay Stripe’s 200.
- `/api/stripe/complete` still awaits notify on first insert (browser success path).
- Classifier: `lib/orders/stripeWebhookResponse.ts`.

## Ops check (Dashboard email)

If failures continue after deploy: Stripe Live endpoint **Signing secret** must match Vercel `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (test `whsec_` ≠ live).
